---
// Pricing tiers — updated for control plane positioning
---

<section id="pricing" class="py-20 px-4" style="background: var(--color-bg-secondary);">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-14" data-reveal>
      <span class="tile-label text-accent">Precios</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 text-text-primary">Planes simples. Sin costos de LLM.</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">BYOM — tú traes tus keys de OpenAI, Anthropic o Google. Nosotros gobernamos.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <!-- Free -->
      <div class="ds-surface p-7 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden" data-reveal>
        <span class="tile-glow" style="background: var(--color-text-tertiary);" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="tile-label relative" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Free</span>
        <div class="mt-3 relative">
          <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-text-primary">$0</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Para developers que quieren probar el control plane sin costo.</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm flex-1 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Memory API (100MB/proyecto)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Policy engine (hasta 3 políticas)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Audit trail local</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> MCP plugin (Claude Code, Cline)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);"><span style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);">✕</span> Sin admin console</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);"><span style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);">✕</span> Sin soporte oficial</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#waitlist" class="btn-pill btn-pill-glass mt-6 w-full py-2.5 text-sm relative">Empezar gratis</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Team (featured) -->
      <div class="ds-surface-elevated p-7 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden" style="border-color: var(--color-accent-blue-tint);" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="150">
        <span class="tile-glow" style="background: var(--color-accent-blue); opacity: 0.28;" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bg-accent text-white text-[10px] font-semibold px-3 py-1 rounded-full">Más popular</div>
        <span class="tile-label relative" style="color: var(--color-accent-blue-hover);">Team</span>
        <div class="mt-3 relative">
          <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-text-primary">$49</span>
          <span class="text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-tertiary);">/mes</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Para equipos que usan múltiples herramientas AI y necesitan control.</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm flex-1 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Todo Open Source +</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Memoria cross-tool ilimitada</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Policy engine completo (políticas ilimitadas)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Audit trail 90d + admin console</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Plugins: Claude Code, Cursor, Copilot, OpenCode</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> SSO (Google, GitHub, Microsoft)</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#waitlist" class="btn-pill btn-pill-primary mt-6 w-full py-2.5 text-sm relative">Unirme a la lista</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Enterprise -->
      <div class="ds-surface p-7 flex flex-col relative overflow-hidden" data-reveal data-reveal-delay="300">
        <span class="tile-glow" style="background: var(--color-status-info);" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="tile-label relative" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Enterprise</span>
        <div class="mt-3 relative">
          <span class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-text-primary">Custom</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm mt-2 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">Self-hosted. Tus datos nunca salen de tu infraestructura. Precio a medida.</p>
        <ul class="mt-5 space-y-2 text-sm flex-1 relative" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Todo Team +</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Self-hosted (single binary / K8s)</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> SOC2 + audit trails inmutables</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Multi-agent orchestration</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> SLA 99.99% + soporte dedicado</li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span style="color: var(--color-status-success);">✓</span> Onboarding asistido 48h</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#waitlist" onclick="document.getElementById('waitlist')?.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'});return false;" class="btn-pill btn-pill-glass mt-6 w-full py-2.5 text-sm relative">Hablar con ventas</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
